"XTimers and Xin Account are operated by Xintech LLC. For identity,\n      recovery, product, deletion, or SMS support, email us at" = "XTimers dan Xin Account dikendalikan oleh Xintech LLC. Untuk sokongan identiti, pemulihan, produk, pemadaman atau SMS, e-mel kami di";
